# The second home screen, PERFORM: HOME again from the tempo page; HOME once more, back. Its keys are the track mix (the
# GLO layer) without GLO; its knobs the FX knobs; the keys are the scale again on any other page.
wait 3000
expect view 0
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 27
# the keys: F3 mutes the kick, G3 the hats; the scale is not touched
tapkey 0
tapkey 2
wait 100
expect trkmute 3
expect pool 0x5AD
# G#3 solo of the hats track (key 3), A#3... (key 5: solo snare), then reset all (E5, key 23)
tapkey 3
wait 100
expect trksolo 2
tapkey 23
wait 100
expect trkmute 0
expect trksolo 0
# a scene: stored by a hold, recalled by a tap, as on the GLO layer (C5, key 19)
tapkey 0
key 19 down
wait 800
key 19 up
wait 100
expect scenes 1
tapkey 0
wait 100
expect trkmute 0
tapkey 19
wait 100
shot perf_queued.png
wait 3000
expect trkmute 1
# the knobs: the FX knobs (crush up)
spin K2 25
wait 100
expect fxk1 25
shot perf_screen.png
# the DJ on (F5, key 24), its length (F#5), and the screen follows
tapkey 24
wait 3000
shot perf_dj.png
expect djon 1
# HOME again: back to the tempo page, where the keys are the scale
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
tapkey 1
expect pool 0x7AD
tapkey 1
# the dial from the perform screen goes on to the next page (HOME twice quickly would be the visualizers)
wait 600
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 27
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
expect view 1
# and from the Global page HOME is the tempo page
wait 600
tap GLO
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
